# <Cookbook Recipe Title>

<Punchline: Implement a production-grade webhook receiver in Node.js or Python that cryptographically verifies HMAC-SHA256 payload signatures and responds with an idempotent 200 OK within 50ms.>

> [!NOTE]
> **Recipe Prerequisites**:
> - Webhook signing secret (`whsec_...`) from Developer Dashboard.
> - Publicly accessible HTTPS URL (use `ngrok http 3000` for local development).

---

## Architecture Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Handler as Webhook Receiver
    participant Queue as Async Job Queue

    Gateway->>Handler: POST /webhooks (Payload + Signature)
    Note over Handler: Verify HMAC-SHA256 Header
    alt Valid Signature
        Handler->>Queue: Enqueue event for async processing
        Handler-->>Gateway: 200 OK (immediate)
    else Invalid Signature
        Handler-->>Gateway: 400 Bad Request
    end
```

